    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=ngPzlEI5pVSdBv86]], one [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=ngPzlEI5pVSdBv86]] within [[lookup @range.value activity=ngPzlEI5pVSdBv86]] feet [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=ngPzlEI5pVSdBv86]].</p><p><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage. The target's Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage taken, and the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} regains Hit Points equal to that amount. A Humanoid reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage and then buried rises the following sunset as a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmVampireSpawn00]{Vampire Spawn}</strong> under the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s control.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: Only a target that is Grappled, Incapacitated or Restrained, or that the GM confirms is willing. On a failure its Hit Point maximum drops by the Necrotic damage taken and the vampire regains that many Hit Points.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
